                  Project: Neslet Setup  
                    Author: UnixeID  
                      Year: 2025  

      Technical Description & Implementation Overview

      A. System-Level Optimization  
      Neslet Setup optimizes Android systems (non-root) using native C code.  
      It performs deep cache cleaning, including `/data/system/dropbox`, 
      Dalvik cache directories, and temp files. It also terminates unneeded 
      background processes that consume excessive memory, without affecting core services.

      B. Game-Specific Tuning  
      The script includes predefined performance profiles for 
      Mobile Legends, PUBG, and Genshin Impact. These profiles dynamically adjust
      runtime parameters like memory management, zram swap priority, and CPU affinity     
       to match each game’s performance demand.

      C. Task Management and Process Scheduling  
      Processes are re-prioritized using `nice`, `renice`, and `oom_score_adj` 
      mechanisms. High-priority processes are elevated, while less important    
      tasks are throttled to free system resources. Schedulers are tweaked using 
      `sched_setscheduler` for latency reduction during gameplay.

      D. Encrypted Configuration Control  
      Configuration data is stored with XOR-based obfuscation 
      to prevent tampering. This mechanism ensures data integrity and reduces
      the risk of unauthorized edits or accidental damage.

      E. Compatibility Handling  
     The script detects Android version via `ro.build.version.release` 
     and adapts behavior accordingly. It supports AOSP, LineageOS, MIUI, and other popular
     ROMs by checking system properties and applying version-specific tweaks.

      F. Diagnostic Logging (Optional)  
      Script operations are logged to `logcat` and local 
      debug buffers for analysis. Logging is disabled by default to avoid I/O  
      bottlenecks, but can be enabled for troubleshooting or development use.

      For questions, contributions, or issue reporting, please contact:  
